  "question": {
    "text": "A block of the mass of <math><mn>1 kg</mn></math> is moving on the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis. A force&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math> acting on the block is shown. The velocity of the block at time <math><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.&nbsp;What is the speed of the block at time <math><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>?<br />\r<br />\r<img src=\"assets\\qt0020_5d422daebced.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 144px;\" />"
  },
